*.[eE][xX][eE]
*.[zZ][iI][pP]
*.[fF][oO][nN]

# Assets extracted from ski32.exe — derived copyrighted content, regenerated
# by tools/extract_assets.py. assets/README.md (instructions) stays tracked.
/assets/*
!/assets/README.md
